      "id": "2027-Quan-2-3",
      "entry": {
        "title": "2027 Quantitative Methods Mod2-Q3",
        "itemBody": "<p>What does the decline in capital distribution returns in long-term government bonds over the period from the early 2000s to early 2020s indicate?</p>",
        "feedback": {
          "neutral": ""
        },
        "interactionData": {
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "6a52c9f0-5e07-4aad-9b23-056e4df9cf2b",
              "itemBody": "<p>A. A shift toward higher equity investments</p>",
              "position": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "d84dc168-cf30-41da-bbe7-9edca0590491",
              "itemBody": "<p>B. A decrease in market interest rates</p>",
              "position": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "24c1be40-cc0d-4558-9cbb-eefde785de34",
              "itemBody": "<p>C. An increase in corporate default rates</p>",
